# REST API

Use REST by default.

Use plural resource routes:

- `GET /habits`
- `GET /habits/:id`
- `POST /habits`
- `PATCH /habits/:id`
- `DELETE /habits/:id`

POST, PUT and PATCH must use DTO validation.
Do not return raw database errors.
Do not introduce GraphQL or API versioning unless requested.
